[5] sum over Euler castles of (-1)^blocks x^(w + blocks) q^area = sum_k (-1)^k (x^(3k-1) q^(k(3k-1)/2) + x^(3k) q^(k(3k+1)/2)), n <= 40: True
[5] signed Euler castles by semi-perimeter, s = 2..19: [-1, -1, 0, 1, 1, 0, -1, -1, 0, 1, 1, 0, -1, -1, 0, 1, 1, 0]
[5] = -A010892(s - 2), the coefficients of -t^2/(1 - t + t^2), s = 2..19: True
[6] transposing (reading the rows as columns) maps the staircase castles of width w and height h onto the Euler castles of width h and height w, w <= 8, h <= 5: True
